{"ref":"BDB, בָּצִיר","hw":"בָּצִיר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּצִיר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.5\">Lv 26:5</a></sup> <strong>vintage (</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּצַר\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּצַר\", dir=\"rtl\">בָּצַר</a><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּצִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.5\">Lv 26:5</a> + 4 times + <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.2\">Zc 11:2</a> Qr (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">בצור</span> Kt); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:2\" href=\"/Judges.8.2\">Ju 8:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצִירֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.32\">Je 48:32</a>;—<em>vintage</em>, lit. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.5\">Lv 26:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:2\" href=\"/Judges.8.2\">Ju 8:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.10\">Is 32:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.32\">Je 48:32</a>; in simile <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.13\">Is 24:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:1\" href=\"/Micah.7.1\">Mi 7:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.2\">Zc 11:2</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">בצור</span> (Kt) and cf. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּצַר\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּצַר\", dir=\"rtl\">בָּצַר</a>.","next":"BDB, מִבְצָר","prev":"BDB, בַּצָּרָה"}